# =============================================================================
# NeoBank — root .gitignore
# Keep the public repo limited to source, build descriptors, and shareable docs.
# =============================================================================

# ----- Build & Maven -----
**/target/
**/build/
**/out/
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
*.nar
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# Maven wrapper binary (regenerate with `mvn wrapper:wrapper` if needed)
**/.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

# ----- IDE & editor -----
.metadata/
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.project
.classpath
.settings/
.factorypath
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ----- OS -----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db

# ----- Logs & temp -----
*.log
logs/
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig

# ----- Secrets & local overrides (never publish) -----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.p12
*.jks
**/application-local.yml
**/application-local.properties
**/application-secret.yml
**/application-secret.properties
**/secrets/
kb/secrets/

# ----- Cursor / AI / local agent artifacts -----
.cursor/
.cursorignore
agent-transcripts/
**/agent-transcripts/

# ----- Progress / audit / internal tracking docs (not for public GitHub) -----
docs/DOCUMENTATION_AUDIT.md
docs/KNOWN_ISSUES_AND_IMPROVEMENTS.md

# ----- Test / coverage output -----
**/test-output/
**/surefire-reports/
**/failsafe-reports/
**/jacoco/
**/jacoco.exec
**/coverage/
*.lcov

# ----- Misc -----
*.hprof
*.pid
.attach_pid*
